gui.chatopt.tip.smart_copy=§eSmart Copy§r\n§7After enabled, click the player name to directly copy the player name.\n§7Internal use /copy <player name> new logic processing.
gui.chatopt.tip.copy_with_format=§ePreserve format when copying§r\n§7When enabled, smart copying will include color codes.
gui.chatopt.tip.anti_spam=§e Anti-swipe §r\n§7 Automatically merge messages that appear repeatedly in a short period of time \n§7 into one line and display the count. \n is not recommended to be used together with other anti-swiping screens.
gui.chatopt.tip.timestamp=§eDisplay timestamp§r\n§7Add the time in [HH:mm:ss] format before each chat message.
gui.chatopt.tip.scroll_bottom=§eScroll to the bottom when swiping the screen§r\n§7When anti-swiping merges messages, \n§7 Whether to automatically scroll the chat box to the latest message.
gui.chatopt.tip.timed_message=§eSend messages regularly§r\n§7After enabled, the specified message will be automatically sent in the chat box according to the set time interval\n§7.
gui.chatopt.tip.mode=§eSend mode§r\n§7Sequential loop: Send messages in list order. \n§7 Randomly send: randomly select one item from the list to send each time.
gui.chatopt.tip.enable_blacklist=§e Enable blacklist§r\n§7 After it is enabled, messages \n§7 that hit the blacklist keywords will be filtered and will not be displayed in the chat box.
gui.chatopt.tip.enable_whitelist=§e Enable whitelist§r\n§7 After it is turned on, only messages that match the whitelist keyword \n§7 will be displayed, and the remaining messages will be filtered.
gui.chatopt.tip.smooth=§eSmooth animation§r\n§7There will be a smooth upward scroll animation when new messages appear.
gui.chatopt.tip.bg_alpha=§eBackground transparency§r\n§7Adjust the transparency of the chat box background. \n§70% is completely opaque (black), \n§7100% is completely transparent.
gui.chatopt.tip.quality=§ePicture quality§r\n%s\n§7Click to switch. Lower quality can significantly reduce memory usage.
gui.chatopt.tip.bg_scale=§eBackground image scaling (%)§r\n§7Range: 10~300. \n§7100 represents the original ratio. The larger the value, the more "enlarged" the display is.
gui.chatopt.tip.bg_crop_x=§eBackground image cropping \n§7 is used to move the picture taking position laterally.
gui.chatopt.tip.bg_crop_y=§e Background image cropping Y§r\n§7 offsets the sampling starting point downward from the upper left corner of the texture. \n§7 is used to move the picture taking position vertically.
